218
00:16:19,440 --> 00:16:20,040
Hi, Pa.

219
00:16:21,400 --> 00:16:21,840
Uhh.

220
00:16:23,960 --> 00:16:25,520
What are you doing here, Pa?

221
00:16:25,760 --> 00:16:28,120
