223
00:16:33,400 --> 00:16:34,560
Forgot about your Pa, huh?

224
00:16:34,840 --> 00:16:35,600
Oh,

225
00:16:36,320 --> 00:16:37,800
how could I forget you, Pa?

226
00:16:38,960 --> 00:16:42,840
I fell asleep right after training all day, Pa.

227
00:16:44,480 --> 00:16:45,520
So, can I help you with something?

228
00:16:46,360 --> 00:16:47,000
Well...

229
00:16:49,480 --> 00:16:49,880
Well...

230
00:16:50,520 --> 00:16:52,120
I was just in the neighborhood

231
00:16:52,520 --> 00:16:54,840
