232
00:16:55,960 --> 00:16:59,160
I also wanted to see if you’re doing okay here.

233
00:17:07,720 --> 00:17:09,360
And how are you doing, Pa?

234
00:17:12,120 --> 00:17:13,800
Can I use the bathroom?

235
00:17:13,800 --> 00:17:15,680
-Then I’ll just leave.
-Oh, right that way.

236
00:17:18,760 --> 00:17:19,560
Right there.

237
00:17:24,720 --> 00:17:25,760
Why is he here?

238
00:17:37,720 --> 00:17:38,560
Yes?

239
00:17:40,840 --> 00:17:41,280
I’ll go.

240
00:17:43,520 --> 00:17:44,720
You’re leaving, Pa?

241
00:17:45,880 --> 00:17:46,920
Don’t forget to eat.

242
00:17:47,320 --> 00:17:47,640
Of…

243
00:17:48,560 --> 00:17:49,840
Of course, I’ll eat it, Pa.

244
00:17:50,880 --> 00:17:51,880
You get home safe.

245
00:17:52,920 --> 00:17:54,080
I’ll drop by when I have time.

246
00:17:55,200 --> 00:17:56,440
Get some rest.

247
00:17:56,880 --> 00:17:57,840
You too, Pa.

248
00:18:00,760 --> 00:18:02,000
Take care of yourself.

249
00:18:02,320 --> 00:18:03,240
Goodbye, Pa.

250
00:18:11,520 --> 00:18:13,160
Don’t know why he was here. Sh*t.

251
00:18:14,960 --> 00:18:16,160
